      "index": 2,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "fats",
      "text": "15 grams of fat. Saturated fat is 0.5 grams, which is nice and low. Omega 3 is 250 milligrams, helping a bit, but not enough to be amazing for seeds. Polyunsaturated fat is 6 grams, which sounds solid, but for seeds it is still not doing loads. There is 9.9 grams of monounsaturated fats though, which brings the score back up a bit.",
