      "index": 3,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "carbs",
      "text": "52 grams of carbs. Fibre is 40 grams, which is massive and easily the best part here. Glycemic index is 15, helping with steadier carb behaviour. Starch is 10 grams, adding some usable carb energy, but fibre is clearly doing the heavy lifting. For seeds, carbs matter most when fibre is this strong.",
