    {
      "id": "06-vitamins",
      "index": 5,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "vitamins",
      "text": "Vitamins are not really showing up here. Vitamin E is 7% daily value, which is too low to score. For seeds, vitamin E matters most, and fennel seeds are not bringing enough of it.",
