    {
      "id": "07-minerals",
      "index": 6,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "minerals",
      "text": "Calcium is 120% daily value, which is huge for bone support. Iron is 100% daily value, adding real oxygen-transport support. Magnesium is 96% daily value, also helping with muscle and nerve support. For seeds, minerals are the clearest reason this works on the stat sheet.",
