    {
      "id": "08-pros",
      "index": 7,
      "kind": "section",
      "sectionKey": "pros",
      "text": "The upsides first: tiny food with real nutrient density. The numbers are genuinely serious for something this small. Easy to add into meals. A small amount can fit into cooking without changing the whole plate. Richer texture can help satisfaction. That can make a sprinkle feel more useful than plain seasoning.",
