    {
      "id": "10-closing_summary",
      "index": 9,
      "kind": "closing_summary",
      "sectionKey": null,
      "text": "Best bits are fibre, calcium, iron, and magnesium. Weak spots are low vitamin E, limited protein quality, and the fact that normal portions are tiny. Best as a small mineral-and-fibre boost in cooking, not as a main food. Basically, the score sheet looks strong, but real-life serving sizes pull it back down.",
